purpose: Why does the engsys core stay POSIX sh while development tools use python3?

Records the decision to keep bin/engsys as dependency-free POSIX sh and limit python3 to tools/* for developing the system repository.
Translated from Korean to English with frontmatter, date 2026-09-07, status accepted, the 850-line figure and the ADR 0002 link unchanged.
Headings mapped to Context, Decision, Alternatives and Consequences; the lead paragraph before the first section is kept.
The revisit trigger (three or more nesting levels, heavy hand edits) and the README prerequisite are preserved as stated.
No Korean literals retained; no facts added or updated to the current implementation.

